## Title: GloryCore
## Notes: Finish the game : points for every feat, goals at your real pace, every zone explored, every quest, dungeon with all its bosses and rares, item, profession, race and class, reputation and PvP rank, with your progress in percent for each character, the Horde, the Alliance and both.
